# StoneToad driver (tools/cov/specs/stonetoad.py): Torvus Bog 09_swamp_catacombs_dark has two
# Watchdrones, e00410048 and e00410066, each sleeping beside an inactive safe zone (e00410043,
# e0041002c) that the room's light crystals switch on. e00410048: the safe zone's Touch wakes it
# (ReactToSafeZone, WakeUp, MoveAway, Wait), Decrement plus the zone switched off send it back
# (MoveBack, GoToSleep, Sleep). e00410066: a direct hit (no projectile) does nothing, light-beam
# and missile shots provoke it (ReactToWeapon), then Increment/Decrement, the message arms, kill.
@f300 god 1; give LightBeam 1; beam light; objs StoneToad; obj e00410048; obj e00410066
@f320 send e00410043 Activate
@f330 damage e00410066 1
@f340 shoot e00410066
@f380 obj e00410048; obj e00410066
@f460 obj e00410048; obj e00410066
@f560 obj e00410048; obj e00410066
@f600 send e00410043 Deactivate; send e00410048 Decrement
@f660 obj e00410048; obj e00410066
@f760 obj e00410048; obj e00410066; shoot e00410066 missile
@f860 obj e00410048; obj e00410066; send e00410066 Increment
@f960 obj e00410048; obj e00410066; send e00410066 Decrement
@f1060 obj e00410048; obj e00410066; send e00410066 AIUpdateDisabled
@f1100 send e00410066 Deactivate; obj e00410066
@f1140 send e00410066 Activate; obj e00410066
@f1200 obj e00410048; kill e00410066
@f1300 obj e00410048; objs StoneToad
